    "description": "Wolf flower marinated tea - unique scented tea Wolf flower marinated tea is one of its kind",
    "contentHtml": "<section class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p></p>\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<div class=\"entry-header-text entry-header-text-bottom text-left\">\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Wolf flower scented tea - unique scented tea </h1>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-content single-page\">\n<p><em>Wolf flower scented tea is one of the very special scented teas, the faint scent of the countryside, wild yet gentle, makes the drinker captivated.There isn't much tea infused with wolf flowers, so it becomes even more precious.Join GEDECO to learn about this unique scented tea!</em></p>\n<p><strong> </strong><strong>What is wolf flower tea?</strong></p>\n<p>Wolf flower scented tea is a tea flavored with <a href=\"https://cayhoacanh.com/cay-hoa-soi/\"></a>wolf flower - a herbaceous plant with many underground roots.The flowers are small, white as rice grains, and the petals bloom very much like the muzzle of a white wolf, so they are called wolf flowers.Wolf flowers emit the most fragrance in the morning and are carefully selected by artisans and marinated with premium Tan Cuong tea.</p>\n<p>Although the wolf flower doesn't have much of a special appearance, it has a unique scent that is hard to describe.Enjoying tea marinated with wolf flowers, you will feel the cool flavor permeating the tip of your tongue.At the same time, it has a mildly acrid and sweet taste that makes people enjoy it passionately.</p>\n<h3><strong>Fragrance process: </strong></h3>\n<p>Tea scented with wolf flowers is not as delicate and meticulous as tea marinated with lotus flowers, however, to have standard batches of scented tea, artisans also need to be careful in the steps and know how to take advantage of the time when the fragrance of wolf flowers is most intense.</p>\n<p>In the morning, after the white flower clusters bloom and give off a fragrant scent, they will be picked and flavored with tea.</p>\n<p>After the wolf flowers are picked, they will be spread evenly on the baskets, layer by layer of flowers and then layer of tea in turn and evenly, corresponding to 300 grams of flowers for 1 kg of tea.</p>\n<p>Finally, the tea pots will be dried in the sun or dried, the increase in temperature will cause the scent of wolf flowers and tea to blend and penetrate until they are set properly, then let cool and packed into individual vacuum bags for preservation.</p>\n<h3><strong>Effects of tea marinated with wolf flowers </strong></h3>\n<p>Wolf flowers in Chinese medicine or traditional Vietnamese medicine are both good medicines with many uses such as eliminating wind, activating blood and dissolving stasis, strengthening tendons and bones, antiseptic and eliminating itching.Therefore, when marinating tea and wolf flowers, it has many health benefits and is always loved and highly appreciated by tea connoisseurs.</p>\n<h4><strong>Detoxify and purify the body </strong></h4>\n<p>The main ingredient in tea is the compound EGCG, which has antioxidant effects, prevents the development of free radicals and controls blood sugar levels.Drinking tea infused with wolf flowers has double the effect, because drinking tea regularly every day in the morning will reduce toxins and the body is continuously eliminated. The faint, pleasant scent of wolf flowers makes the mood extremely relaxed and comfortable, thus keeping the body healthy.</p>\n<h4><strong>Reduces joint pain and arthritis </strong></h4>\n<p>Wolf flower has many effects in treating inflammation, good for tendons and bones. Combined with tea and water, regularly used to fight inflammation and inhibit the growth of disease-causing cells very well.</p>\n<p><em>Wolf flower tea has many health benefits. </em></p>\n<h4><strong>Reduces the risk of cardiovascular disease, blood pressure, and diabetes.</strong></h4>\n<p>Wolf flower-infused tea has a faint, pleasant aroma and is easy to drink. According to studies, drinking wolf-flower tea helps reduce the incidence of diabetes compared to normal people, and the continuous increase or decrease in blood pressure or cardiovascular disease.Thereby reducing the risk of stroke, especially in the elderly.</p>\n<p>In addition, if you maintain a regular and scientific tea drinking regimen, it will also help reduce the incidence of serious diseases compared to people who do not drink tea regularly.</p>\n<h4><strong>Beauty effects </strong></h4>\n<p>People who drink tea regularly and have a regular exercise regimen will usually have a more supple body and better resistance.A healthy body will have balanced skin and physique, giving you confidence to communicate.</p>\n<h3><strong>Things to note when making tea: </strong></h3>\n<p>Water: When making scented tea, do not mix it with water that is too hot, an average temperature of about 80°C will help the tea retain its full flavor, too hot will lose the flavor of the tea, and too cool will not make the tea bloom.</p>\n<p>Adjusting the water in the pot: Normally, when making scented tea, you should not fill the pot with water but leave some space for the scented tea to radiate its scent without the scent escaping.</p>\n<h3><strong>Buy tea scented with wolf flowers at GEDECO </strong></h3>\n<p>All scented tea products are marinated with premium teas and natural flowers without using industrial flavorings in the land of Xinjiang - Thai Nguyen.Dear tea lovers, please enjoy.</p></div>\n<p></p>\n</section>",
